sequenceDiagram
    participant App as MCP Server (startup)
    participant Auth as ecommerce-auth-server
    participant MCP as MCP Server (runtime)
    participant Caller as MCP Client
    participant Mgr as OAuth2AuthorizedClientManager
    participant RC as RestClient (+Interceptor)
    participant Agent as ecommerce-api-server

    Note over App,Auth: Startup phase
    App->>Auth: GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server (issuer-uri discovery)
    Auth-->>App: JWKS URI, token endpoint
    App->>App: Build JwtDecoder, SecurityFilterChain
    App->>App: Build AuthorizedClientManager + RestClient(interceptor) beans

    Note over Caller,Agent: Runtime: tool call
    Caller->>MCP: POST /mcp (Bearer JWT) tools/call
    MCP->>Auth: (lazy, cached) GET JWKS to verify signature
    MCP->>MCP: Validate inbound JWT (resource server)
    MCP->>MCP: Invoke @Tool method -> EcommerceApiClient
    MCP->>RC: restClient.get()/post()...
    RC->>Mgr: authorize(clientRegistrationId="agent-api")
    alt no cached/valid token
        Mgr->>Auth: POST /oauth2/token (client_credentials, mcp-server-client)
        Auth-->>Mgr: access_token
    else cached token valid
        Mgr-->>RC: reuse cached token
    end
    RC->>Agent: HTTP request + Authorization: Bearer (mcp token)
    Agent->>Auth: (lazy, cached) validate JWT via JWKS
    Agent-->>RC: JSON response
    RC-->>MCP: DTO
    MCP-->>Caller: tool result
